Package: easydta
Title: Cochrane-Compliant Diagnostic Test Accuracy Meta-Analysis in R
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Course", "Author", email = "author@example.org",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Pedagogical, lme4-based workflow for bivariate binomial GLMM
    meta-analysis of diagnostic test accuracy studies, following the
    Cochrane Handbook for Systematic Reviews of Diagnostic Test Accuracy
    (v2.0, 2023) Chapter 10 Supplementary Material 1 (Takwoingi et al.).
    Implements the methods Cochrane explicitly endorses, with no external
    diagnostic-meta-analysis dependencies.
    Includes single-test fitting, pairwise meta-regression with likelihood
    ratio tests, delta-method CIs for DOR/LR+/LR-, the Zhou & Dendukuri
    (2014) bivariate I-squared, coupled forest plots, and SROC plots with
    confidence and prediction regions.
